Infrastructure Configuration
SNS topic
Resource: aws_sns_topic.nautilus_sns_topic
- Name: nautilus-sns-topic
SQS queue
Resource: aws_sqs_queue.nautilus_sqs_queue
- Name: nautilus-sqs-queue
SQS queue policy
Resource: aws_sqs_queue_policy.nautilus_sqs_policy

The queue policy grants the SNS service permission to perform sqs:SendMessage. Its aws:SourceArn condition restricts that permission to the SNS topic created by this configuration.
SNS subscription
Resource: aws_sns_topic_subscription.nautilus_sns_subscription
- Protocol: sqs
- Endpoint: the ARN of nautilus-sqs-queue
- Raw message delivery: enabled
The subscription depends on the queue policy so that the permission is configured before the subscription is created.
Terraform Outputs
The outputs.tf file defines:
Output	Description
kke_sns_topic_arn	ARN of the SNS topic
kke_sqs_queue_url	URL of the SQS queue


